hments/assets/10fce220-1bb2-43da-ae53-4b236cd5b770\" />\n\nThing is, that if you disable the preview environment, the issue dissapears, might be related to the sky used by the environment. I have the same issue in other projects with custom worldenvironment added to the tree node, when deleting the sky, the meshes are rendered correctly. This is how it looks with the preview environment disabled:\n\n<img width=\"3823\" height=\"2052\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49205ab7-6c12-4cc5-ab52-7b0261da12cd\" />\n\nIf I rollback my driver to a previous version (591.86) the issue does not reproduce anymore.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4328262015/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4328931850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118772#issuecomment-4328931850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118772","id":4328931850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAgZCCg","user":{"login":"jonazuknik","id":124939384,"node_id":"U_kgDOB3JseA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124939384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonazuknik","html_url":"https://github.com/jonazuknik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonazuknik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonazuknik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonazuknik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonazuknik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonazuknik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonazuknik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonazuknik/repos","events_url":"https://a