"updated_at":"2026-04-28T10:08:32Z","body":"Why was this issue closed? I don't see a solution and it's still a problem with the latest driver (Nvidia 596.21). Can it be reopened?\n\nWe also have problems with Glow and Reflection Probes as a result of this bug.\nMy environment background is set to Sky in 4.5.2, using Sky3D.\nProcess Mode: Automatic\nRadiance size: 256  \n\nSo far, we have notes that the last known good version of the NVidia driver was 591.86, while the latest 596.21 exibits these problems on 50-series cards only. There are 3 other driver versions between those two that might also work: 595.71, 595.79, 595.97.\n\nSide note to op, Godot doesn't fully support D3D12 in 4.5 so Terrain3D doesn't work on it until 4.6.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4334083938/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4335197899","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118772#issuecomment-4335197899","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118772","id":4335197899,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAmXeyw","user":{"login":"TokisanGames","id":632766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/632766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames","html_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https